      <div class="tour-body"><div class="tour-duration">7 Days</div><h3>7-Day Gansu &amp; Qinghai Discovery</h3><p>Explore Dunhuang's Mogao Caves, ride camels on the Singing Sand Dunes, then journey to Qinghai's stunning Qinghai Lake and the colorful Zhangye Danxia landforms. A perfect blend of Silk Road history and natural wonders.</p><a href="/tour/7d-gansu-qinghai.html" class="btn btn-outline">View Tour</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tour-card reveal">
      <div class="tour-image"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Silk Road Group Tour" width="1200" height="800"></div>
      <div class="tour-body"><div class="tour-duration">13 Days</div><h3>13-Day Silk Road Group Tour</h3><p>Journey the entire Silk Road from Xi'an to Kashgar, with an unforgettable stop in Dunhuang. Explore the Mogao Caves, ride camels on the dunes, and experience the Hexi Corridor — the most evocative stretch of the ancient trade route.</p><a href="/tour/13d-silk-road-group.html" class="btn btn-outline">View Tour</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tour-card reveal">
      <div class="tour-image"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Private Dunhuang Tour" width="1200" height="800"></div>
